### Student Management System API Test Requests (REST Client / VS Code)

@baseUrl = http://localhost:5000/api/students

### 1. Root API Health Check
GET http://localhost:5000/

### 2. Add New Student (Alice)
POST {{baseUrl}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "studentId": "STU1001",
  "name": "Alice Johnson",
  "email": "alice.johnson@example.com",
  "course": "Computer Science",
  "age": 20,
  "gpa": 3.85
}

### 3. Add Another Student (Bob)
POST {{baseUrl}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "studentId": "STU1002",
  "name": "Bob Smith",
  "email": "bob.smith@example.com",
  "course": "Electrical Engineering",
  "age": 22,
  "gpa": 3.40
}

### 4. View All Students
GET {{baseUrl}}

### 5. Filter Students by Course
GET {{baseUrl}}?course=Computer Science

### 6. Search Students by keyword
GET {{baseUrl}}?search=Alice

### 7. View Single Student by studentId or _id
# Replace with actual studentId or MongoDB _id
GET {{baseUrl}}/STU1001

### 8. Update Student (Full or Partial)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/STU1001
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "gpa": 3.95,
  "course": "Data Science"
}

### 9. Delete Student
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/STU1001

### 10. Test Validation Error (Invalid Email & Negative Age)
POST {{baseUrl}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "studentId": "STU9999",
  "name": "Invalid Student",
  "email": "not-an-email",
  "course": "Physics",
  "age": -5
}
